    "title": "KF154 WATCH FACE",
    "description": "<b>BUE ONE GET ONE OFFER:</b>\r\n https://sites.google.com/view/kfbogo?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n<b> The  KF154 is a Analog watch face for Wear OS by KF.</b>\r\nKF is a new product in the selection of dials for smart watches Wear OS. Analog, Digital, Hybrid dials for your watch..\r\n\r\nWatch face features:\r\n- WF with customizable shortcuts, fixed shortcuts for calendar and energy consumption information. \r\n- Day of week\r\n- Date\r\n- Month \r\n- Moon phase\r\n- BPM Heart Rate (beats per minute)\r\n- Steps *\r\n- Distance (KM, ML)*,**\r\n- Battery %\r\n- Customizable shortcut ( 2 icons can be hidden at the user's request)\r\n- Preset Shortcuts\r\n- Customizable field / complication  (depends on the watch)\r\n- Always On Display\r\n- Changeable colors\r\n- Changeable Hands\r\n\r\n* Shows the value of the sensors(Steps/Distance) one at a time - 5 seconds. In AOD mode, only the number of steps completed is displayed.\r\n** Mileage will be automatically displayed on devices with the language set (British or American English). For other languages, the distance will be indicated in km.\r\n\r\nWatch face customization:\r\n1 - Touch and hold display\r\n2 - Tap on customize option  \r\n\r\n<b> Some features may not be available on some watches. <b>\r\n\r\n<b>Watch face installation notes on smart watch:</b>\r\nPhone app serves only as a placeholder to make it easier to install & find the watch face on your Wear OS watch. You have to select your watch device from the install dropdown menu. \r\nNote. If you are stuck in the payment cycle, don't worry: only one payment will be made, even if you are asked to pay a second time. Wait 5 minutes or restart the watch and try again.\r\nThere may be a problem with syncing your device with Google servers.\r\n\r\nPlease note that any problems on this side are not the fault of the developer. On this side, the developer has no control over the Play Store.\r\n\r\n<b> This watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API level 30+ </b>\r\n\r\n<b>TELEGRAM:</b>\r\nhttps://t.me/KFwatchfaces\r\n\r\n<b>FACEBOOK:</b>\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/620092163327987/\r\n\r\n<b>INSTAGRAM:</b>\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/krek_free_watchface</b></b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>BUE ONE GET ONE OFFER:</b><br> https://sites.google.com/view/kfbogo?usp=sharing<br><br><b> The  KF154 is a Analog watch face for Wear OS by KF.</b><br>KF is a new product in the selection of dials for smart watches Wear OS. Analog, Digital, Hybrid dials for your watch..<br><br>Watch face features:<br>- WF with customizable shortcuts, fixed shortcuts for calendar and energy consumption information. <br>- Day of week<br>- Date<br>- Month <br>- Moon phase<br>- BPM Heart Rate (beats per minute)<br>- Steps *<br>- Distance (KM, ML)*,**<br>- Battery %<br>- Customizable shortcut ( 2 icons can be hidden at the user&#39;s request)<br>- Preset Shortcuts<br>- Customizable field / complication  (depends on the watch)<br>- Always On Display<br>- Changeable colors<br>- Changeable Hands<br><br>* Shows the value of the sensors(Steps/Distance) one at a time - 5 seconds. In AOD mode, only the number of steps completed is displayed.<br>** Mileage will be automatically displayed on devices with the language set (British or American English). For other languages, the distance will be indicated in km.<br><br>Watch face customization:<br>1 - Touch and hold display<br>2 - Tap on customize option  <br><br><b> Some features may not be available on some watches. <b><br><br><b>Watch face installation notes on smart watch:</b><br>Phone app serves only as a placeholder to make it easier to install &amp; find the watch face on your Wear OS watch. You have to select your watch device from the install dropdown menu. <br>Note. If you are stuck in the payment cycle, don&#39;t worry: only one payment will be made, even if you are asked to pay a second time. Wait 5 minutes or restart the watch and try again.<br>There may be a problem with syncing your device with Google servers.<br><br>Please note that any problems on this side are not the fault of the developer. On this side, the developer has no control over the Play Store.<br><br><b> This watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API level 30+ </b><br><br><b>TELEGRAM:</b><br>https://t.me/KFwatchfaces<br><br><b>FACEBOOK:</b><br>https://www.facebook.com/groups/620092163327987/<br><br><b>INSTAGRAM:</b><br>https://www.instagram.com/krek_free_watchface</b></b>",
